 "text": "Westfield Specialty Grain\n0\nSkip to Content\nGrain\nCash Bids\nDiscounts\nFoodgrade Soybean Program\nNon-GMO Soybean Program\nNews\nResources\nPlot Results\nProfit Talks\nContact Us\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nGrain\nCash Bids\nDiscounts\nFoodgrade Soybean Program\nNon-GMO Soybean Program\nNews\nResources\nPlot Results\nProfit Talks\nContact Us\nFolder:\nGrain\nNews\nFolder:\nResources\nContact Us\nBack\nCash Bids\nDiscounts\nFoodgrade Soybean Program\nNon-GMO Soybean Program\nBack\nPlot Results\nProfit Talks\nNEXT LEVEL FOOD.\nNEXT LEVEL FARMING.\nItem 1 of 8\nAgVision Anytime\nWestfield is currently a buyer of commodity grains with a goal of developing value-added markets such as our foodgrade soybean market.\nGrain Cash Bids\nWe specialize in the identity-preserved market as well as the commercial commodity markets. Our marketing plan focuses on consumer demand both domestically and internationally.\nWith market insights and industry expertise, Westfield is committed to helping farmers navigate the complexities of grain marketing to maximize their profits.\nNews\nFeatured\nProfit Talks: September & October 2024\nA new Profit Talks report is here from White Commercial. Read the full report to hear more about unappealing prices as we head into harvest and strategies to overcome this.\nRead more →\nProfit Talks: March & April 2024\nA new Profit Talks report is here from White Commercial. Read the full report to learn how to capitalize on uncertainty as we head into planting season.\nRead more →\nNon-GMO Weed Control Workshop\nWestfield Grain recently hosted a workshop that equipped farmers with the knowledge to increase their Non-GMO soybean yields and highlighted the strength of community partnerships in agricultural education.\nRead more →\nContact Us\n(330) 637-3388\ninfo@westfieldgrain.com\n← | Move left |\n→ | Move right |\n↑ | Move up |\n↓ | Move down |\n+ | Zoom in |\n- | Zoom out |\nHome | Jump left by 75% |\nEnd | Jump right by 75% |\nPage Up | Jump up by 75% |\nPage Down | Jump down by 75% |\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\n&token= \" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; user-select: none; border: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; max-width: none;\">\nMap Data Map data ©2026\nMap data ©2026\n200 m\nClick to toggle between metric and imperial units\nTerms\nCash Bids\nGET IN TOUCH\nWSG News\nBESbswy",
